From 8e0ebf0c6b33aedd6e000a798fefba2dea45197a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/24] drm/panel: add Samsung S6E3HA2 Galaxy Tab S2 8.0 panel
 driver

1536x2048 AMOLED command-mode panel of the SM-T715.  Reads the panel MTP,
ELVSS and TSET values and computes the per-level gamma with the vendor
dynamic-AID algorithm; brightness through a backlight device (0-255).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
